---
/**
 * ============================================================================
 * ABOUT SECTION (About.astro)
 * ============================================================================
 * What this component does:
 * - Introduces your background, work approach, and personal philosophy.
 * - Links to your downloadable resume PDF.
 * - Displays your profile photo.
 *
 * HOW TO MAINTAIN:
 * 1) To update your resume:
 *    - Put your new PDF file into the `public/` directory named `jdayres.pdf`
 *      (it replaces the old one automatically, keeping links intact).
 * 2) To update your profile photo:
 *    - Put your new photo into the `public/` directory named `profilePic.jpeg`.
 * 3) To edit your bio paragraphs:
 *    - Edit the <p> tags inside the <div class="intro-copy"> below.
 * ============================================================================
 */
---

<section id="about" class="intro-section container">
  <div class="intro-copy">
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>
      I build software with a practical, people-first mindset. My path
      blends engineering depth with real experience teaching, listening,
      and adapting in fast-paced environments. I enjoy turning complexity
      into clear, useful outcomes that help teams and users move forward.
    </p>
    <p>
      The way I work is grounded in communication, creative
      problem-solving, and rapid learning. These strengths have been
      shaped in classrooms, customer-facing roles, and challenging
      academic projects where persistence and critical thinking were
      non-negotiable.
    </p>
    <p>
      Here is a better look at my professional experience -&gt;
      <a
        href="/jdayres.pdf"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >Resume (PDF)</a
      >
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="photo-wrapper">
    <img
      src="/profilePic.jpeg"
      alt="That's Me!"
    />
  </div>
</section>
